{
  // ==========================================================================
  // AGM PROPOSAL — PLAZA 600  ·  Cloudflare Worker with static assets
  // --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // The static proposal lives in ./public and is served through the Worker in
  // ./src/index.js, which enforces the password gate.
  //
  // "run_worker_first": true is LOAD-BEARING. Without it Cloudflare's asset
  // server answers requests for ./public files directly and the Worker never
  // runs — which would publish the proposal with no password screen at all.
  // Do not remove it.
  // ==========================================================================
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "600-building-proposal",
  "main": "src/index.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-09-02",

  "assets": {
    "directory": "./public",
    "binding": "ASSETS",
    "run_worker_first": true
  },

  "observability": {
    "enabled": true
  },

  // The *.workers.dev URL, now OFF.
  //
  // ⚠️  DEPLOY ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING. Turning this off removes the only
  //     hostname the Worker answers on until a custom domain is attached.
  //     Attach proposal.agmrealestategroup.com FIRST (Worker → Domains, then
  //     the DNS record), confirm it serves the cover page, and only then
  //     deploy this. Deploying it first takes the proposal offline.
  //
  // It is off because workers.dev is on the Public Suffix List, which makes
  // every *.workers.dev subdomain its own registrable site. An iframe of one
  // on agmrealestategroup.com is cross-site, so the session cookie is a
  // third-party cookie and browsers drop it — which is what broke the embed
  // on the Wix page. A subdomain of agmrealestategroup.com is same-site and
  // does not have that problem. See "Embedding" in README.md.
  "workers_dev": false,

  // Per-version Preview URLs are ON. This is the Workers equivalent of a Pages
  // branch preview: `wrangler versions upload` creates a version that is NOT
  // serving production traffic and gives it its own URL to review.
  // The gate applies to preview URLs exactly as it does to production, because
  // run_worker_first makes the Worker handle every request on every hostname.
  // Set false to stop issuing them.
  "preview_urls": true

  // Secrets are NOT set here — they are encrypted Cloudflare secrets.
  //   npx wrangler secret put SITE_PASSWORD
  //   npx wrangler secret put GATE_SECRET
  // Optional analytics (plain vars are fine):
  //   POSTHOG_KEY, POSTHOG_HOST
  // For local development put all of them in .dev.vars (git-ignored).
}
